{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-016",
    "title": "灵脉城门"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_084",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "“第三盏从未进入这座城。”",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "天亮后，无灯镇恢复了白日的样子。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2482,
          "end": 2482
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "墙缝里的青光消失，镇民打开门，把昨夜撒在门槛上的灰叶扫进沟里。低地的土堆被重新填平，石板和铜丝都不见了，仿佛那里从来没有一口井。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2484,
          "end": 2484
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "只有客舍门前多了一道湿脚印，通向镇外。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2486,
          "end": 2486
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临和顾长离收拾行囊。白发老妇没有挽留，只给他们两块烙饼和一包干燥的灰叶。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2488,
          "end": 2488
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“北门不能走。”她说，“旧驿道往西，有座废桥。过桥之后，别让任何人替你们点灯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2490,
          "end": 2490
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“叶观澜在哪里？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2492,
          "end": 2492
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "老妇看了他一眼：“你问的是名字，还是人？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2494,
          "end": 2494
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2496,
          "end": 2496
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那就去废桥。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2498,
          "end": 2498
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "废桥在镇外三里。桥身只剩一半，桥墩上长满黑色苔藓。叶观澜站在桥中央，手里提着那盏没有灯芯的小灯。看见陆照临，他没有寒暄。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2500,
          "end": 2500
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你们带来了第二盏灯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2502,
          "end": 2502
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离挡在灯前：“它不属于你。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2504,
          "end": 2504
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“三年前也有人这么说。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2506,
          "end": 2506
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那个人是谁？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2508,
          "end": 2508
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你不该问名。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2510,
          "end": 2510
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离的手搭上铜针：“你总拿规矩挡问题。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2512,
          "end": 2512
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“规矩是死人的遗言。”叶观澜说，“问题是活人的路。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2514,
          "end": 2514
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他从袖中取出一张折叠地图，摊在桥栏上。地图上标着无灯镇、旧驿道和一座被朱砂圈起的废弃灵脉城。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2516,
          "end": 2516
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“陆沉舟最后一次被看见，是在这座城门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2518,
          "end": 2518
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看见地图边缘的印记，与第二盏灯中出现的雪地城门完全相同。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2520,
          "end": 2520
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你说他替归墟盟送过信。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2522,
          "end": 2522
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他送的不是信，是一枚没有写字的灯牌。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2524,
          "end": 2524
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“给谁？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2526,
          "end": 2526
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“给城里仍然记得旧灾的人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2528,
          "end": 2528
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离指着地图上的朱砂圈：“这座城已经废弃。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2530,
          "end": 2530
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“城废了，记得的人没有。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2532,
          "end": 2532
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜将地图推向陆照临：“我可以带你们进城。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2534,
          "end": 2534
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“条件？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2536,
          "end": 2536
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“把残印的拓痕交给我。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2538,
          "end": 2538
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临没有拿地图：“你要拓痕做什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2540,
          "end": 2540
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“确认太虚遗脉是否已经苏醒。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2542,
          "end": 2542
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“如果已经苏醒呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2544,
          "end": 2544
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那就赶在它醒透之前，找到第二枚残印。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2546,
          "end": 2546
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你们想利用残印？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2548,
          "end": 2548
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜看向她：“归墟盟里有人想毁掉它，有人想把它交还给天下人，也有人想用它重写自己的过去。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2550,
          "end": 2550
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你是哪一种？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2552,
          "end": 2552
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我还没有决定。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2554,
          "end": 2554
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离冷笑：“你倒诚实。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2556,
          "end": 2556
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“诚实只在不影响交易时有用。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2558,
          "end": 2558
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "桥下水声忽然停了。叶观澜把小灯放在桥栏上，灯罩内浮出一片模糊的字：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2560,
          "end": 2560
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“盟约三条：不点灯，不问名，不替死人作证。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2562,
          "end": 2562
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临盯着第三条：“为什么不能替死人作证？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2564,
          "end": 2564
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为死人的记忆会改变。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2566,
          "end": 2566
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“记忆怎么会改变？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2568,
          "end": 2568
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你已经见过。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2570,
          "end": 2570
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜指向他的掌心。黑线遮住的残印微微发热，陆照临却忽然想不起父亲修灯时常用的锉刀放在哪一侧。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2572,
          "end": 2572
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "那只是一个微不足道的习惯，却又一次从他记忆里滑走。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2574,
          "end": 2574
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“拓痕。”叶观澜伸手，“现在给我，或者等进城后再给。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2576,
          "end": 2576
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临取出一张纸。纸上是他在废井旁凭记忆画出的半枚残印，纹路并不完整，缺口也与掌心印记不同。他把纸递过去，却在叶观澜接手前收回。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2578,
          "end": 2578
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我可以给你一半。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2580,
          "end": 2580
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "桥下忽然传来一声敲击。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-063",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2606,
          "end": 2606
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "不是灯罩，像有人在桥墩内部敲了一下。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-064",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2608,
          "end": 2608
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜收起小灯：“他们来了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-065",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2610,
          "end": 2610
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "远处旧驿道上出现几名黑衣人。为首者没有佩剑，腰间挂着一串铜片，每走一步，铜片便相互碰撞，发出细碎的声响。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-066",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2612,
          "end": 2612
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离问：“归墟盟的人？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-067",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2614,
          "end": 2614
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“一部分。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-068",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2616,
          "end": 2616
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“另一部分呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-069",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2618,
          "end": 2618
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“想把我们都送进归墟的人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-070",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2620,
          "end": 2620
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“叶观澜，盟主召你回去。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-072",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2624,
          "end": 2624
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "极近。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-100",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2681,
          "end": 2681
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻看他：“活着不等于被允许记住。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2795,
          "end": 2795
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离捡起一块碎石，轻轻刮过裂缝。石屑下面露出一个完整的“顾”字，后面却被人用刀刃切断。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2797,
          "end": 2797
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她的呼吸变得急促。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2799,
          "end": 2799
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我叔父来过这里。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2801,
          "end": 2801
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他不是来修城的。”慧闻说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2803,
          "end": 2803
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那他来做什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2805,
          "end": 2805
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“把一盏灯送进城心。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-057",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2807,
          "end": 2807
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临想起无灯镇守灯人的话：第二盏灯照活人。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2809,
          "end": 2809
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“灯现在在哪里？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2811,
          "end": 2811
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻指向青灯下的拱门：“还在城心。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-060",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2813,
          "end": 2813
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“第三盏呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-061",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2815,
          "end": 2815
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“第三盏从未进入这座城。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-062",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2817,
          "end": 2817
        }
      }
    ],
